OL,3,ATrump unveils 'Super Intelligence
OL,4,AForce' to oversee AI policy
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has unveiled
OL,7,Fa new taskforce focused on artificial
OL,8,Fintelligence, which will be led by
OL,9,FDirector of National Intelligence Jay
OL,10,FClayton.
OL,12,FThe "Super Intelligence Force" will
OL,13,Fwork to ensure that the US continues to
OL,14,Flead in the technology's development
OL,15,Fand will coordinate the government's
OL,16,Fengagement with the public, Trump
OL,17,Fposted on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
